format: 2
name: a switch over a record type (K2)
class: Probe
method: m
arg: 03
expect: REJECT JULC0007
note: ADR-067 K2, open question 4: legal Java (3).
note: ADR-067 M1 (interim): the selector rejection is now coded, JULC0007; open question 4 decides the final verdict in M2b. REJECT none at the base.
---
import java.math.BigInteger;

public class Probe {
    record R1(BigInteger x) {}
    record R2(BigInteger x) {}

    public static BigInteger m(BigInteger a) {
        R1 r = new R1(a);
        return switch (r) {
            case R1(var x) -> x;
        };
    }
}
